{"id":"db9f535fdb8a1399","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-topo11-path-connected-subspace.md","title":"ZFC Topo11 Path Connected Subspace","display":"df-zfc-topo11-path-connected-subspace — ZFC Topo11 Path Connected Subspace","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo11-path-connected-subspace","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo11-path-connected-subspace"],"display":"df-zfc-topo11-path-connected-subspace — ZFC Topo11 Path Connected Subspace","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo11-path-connected-subspace"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo11-path-connected-subspace</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo11-path-connected-subspace — ZFC Topo11 Path Connected Subspace"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"44867449c3df728b\" href=\"?note=44867449c3df728b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\tau)\">\\((X,\\tau)\\)</span> (topological-space candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq X\">\\(C\\subseteq X\\)</span> (subspace carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_C=\\{U\\cap C:U\\in\\tau\\}\">\\(\\tau_C=\\{U\\cap C:U\\in\\tau\\}\\)</span> (subspace topology)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_I\">\\(\\tau_I\\)</span> (unit-interval topology defined extensionally in the assertion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S\\)</span> (continuous-map predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"44867449c3df728b\" href=\"?note=44867449c3df728b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11PathConnectedSubspace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11PathConnectedSubspace}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo11\\text{-}path\\text{-}connected\\text{-}subspace}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11PathConnectedSubspace}_S(C,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\nC\\subseteq X\n\\land\n\\exists\\tau_C,\\tau_I\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\tau_C=\\{U\\cap C:U\\in\\tau\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\tau_I=\\{U\\subseteq[0,1]:\\forall t\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall s\\in[0,1]\\;(|s-t|&lt;\\varepsilon\\to s\\in U)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(C,\\tau_C)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S([0,1],\\tau_I)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in C\\;\\exists\\gamma\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\gamma,[0,1],C)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S\n(\\gamma,[0,1],\\tau_I,C,\\tau_C)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land\n\\gamma(0)=x\n\\land\n\\gamma(1)=y\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo11\\text{-}path\\text{-}connected\\text{-}subspace}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11PathConnectedSubspace}_S(C,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\nC\\subseteq X\n\\land\n\\exists\\tau_C,\\tau_I\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\tau_C=\\{U\\cap C:U\\in\\tau\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\tau_I=\\{U\\subseteq[0,1]:\\forall t\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall s\\in[0,1]\\;(|s-t|&lt;\\varepsilon\\to s\\in U)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(C,\\tau_C)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S([0,1],\\tau_I)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in C\\;\\exists\\gamma\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\gamma,[0,1],C)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S\n(\\gamma,[0,1],\\tau_I,C,\\tau_C)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land\n\\gamma(0)=x\n\\land\n\\gamma(1)=y\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Paths are typed into the induced subspace topology, and the Euclidean topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,1]\">\\([0,1]\\)</span> is defined in the assertion rather than hidden in prose.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map","status":"resolved","id":"44867449c3df728b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S$ (topological-space predicate, see [[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map","status":"resolved","id":"44867449c3df728b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S$ (continuous-map predicate, see [[../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"C\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_C=\\{U\\cap C:U\\in\\tau\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11PathConnectedSubspace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo11\\text{-}path\\text{-}connected\\text{-}subspace}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11PathConnectedSubspace}_S(C,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\nC\\subseteq X\n\\land\n\\exists\\tau_C,\\tau_I\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\tau_C=\\{U\\cap C:U\\in\\tau\\}\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\tau_I=\\{U\\subseteq[0,1]:\\forall t\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\n\\forall s\\in[0,1]\\;(|s-t|<\\varepsilon\\to s\\in U)\\}\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(C,\\tau_C)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S([0,1],\\tau_I)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in C\\;\\exists\\gamma\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\gamma,[0,1],C)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S\n(\\gamma,[0,1],\\tau_I,C,\\tau_C)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\qquad\\land\n\\gamma(0)=x\n\\land\n\\gamma(1)=y\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"[0,1]","display":false}],"bytes":2108,"backlinks":[{"id":"359c4edee4769bf4","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11PathConnectedSubspace}_S\\subseteq V^3$（参数顺序为“子空间、环境载体、环境拓扑”，see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-topo11-path-connected-subspace.md]]）"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3688","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-topo11-path-connected-subspace.md|58-df-zfc-